# NOTE: git has no inline comments. A comment after a pattern on the same line
# becomes part of the pattern, and the rule then matches nothing.

# Homey: build output from `homey app build/install`, and packed archives
.homeybuild/
*.tar.gz

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Local-only reference material: manuals, product photos, anything that informs
# the work rather than being part of it. Bundling the PDFs once pushed the app
# archive to 60 MB and `homey app install` died on the upload timeout, so this
# directory is excluded from the app bundle too — see .homeyignore.
local/

# Claude Code — personal/local artifacts, never committed.
# CLAUDE.md is deliberately NOT here: it is the project's shared context file,
# carrying findings the code cannot state on its own — the protocol, the
# hardware measurements, and the mistakes not worth repeating.
.claude/
.devcontainer/claude-memory/
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude.json

